From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: recognize riscv64 in SetUpLinux

Upstream-Status: To upstream [ROOT's cmake/modules/SetUpLinux.cmake, pulled into cling/src by create_src_directory.py]

CheckCompiler.cmake include()s SetUpLinux.cmake on every Linux build, and
its processor dispatch has no riscv64 branch, so configure aborts with
"Unknown processor: riscv64" before anything is compiled. Set
ROOT_ARCHITECTURE to linuxriscv64, which the existing
`ROOT_ARCHITECTURE MATCHES riscv64` branch in src/interpreter/
CMakeLists.txt already maps to the RISCV LLVM target, mirroring the
aarch64/ppc64/s390x branches.

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 cling/src/cmake/modules/SetUpLinux.cmake | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cling/src/cmake/modules/SetUpLinux.cmake b/cling/src/cmake/modules/SetUpLinux.cmake
--- a/cling/src/cmake/modules/SetUpLinux.cmake
+++ b/cling/src/cmake/modules/SetUpLinux.cmake
@@ -89,6 +89,17 @@
   else()
     message(FATAL_ERROR "There is no Setup for this compiler up to now. Don't know what to do. Stop cmake at this point.")
   endif()
+elseif(CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR MATCHES riscv64)
+  message(STATUS "Found a 64bit RISC-V system")
+  if(CMAKE_COMPILER_IS_GNUCXX)
+    message(STATUS "Found GNU compiler collection")
+    set(ROOT_ARCHITECTURE linuxriscv64)
+  elseif(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID STREQUAL Clang)
+    message(STATUS "Found CLANG compiler")
+    set(ROOT_ARCHITECTURE linuxriscv64)
+  else()
+    message(FATAL_ERROR "There is no Setup for this compiler up to now. Don't know what to do. Stop cmake at this point.")
+  endif()
 else()
   message(FATAL_ERROR "Unknown processor: ${CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR}")
 endif()
